    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;When the call comes. Will you be the one to answer?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel back to the glory days of the 80's with this arcade inspired space bullet hell.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player you navigate the Javelin, a spaceship fitted with a state of the art weapon arsenal and it's your job to\u00a0 defeat the enemies and bosses in order to unlock powerful new power-ups that can help you on your journey.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter powerful enemies, challenging bosses and many hidden secrets within the arcade realm of Splicer.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get the highest score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power through and reach a higher score to cement your place among the best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel the legends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery surrounding the Palladins as you champion through the game. Each tidbit of information will help you piece together the puzzle. Who were they? Where are they now?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock your potential</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses to unlock new power-ups to enhance your next run and increase your chances at going defeating the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as the classics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate the retro filter in order to get the authentic 80's feel of old CRT monitors.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full controller support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splicer has full controller support for most modern controllers and is best enjoyed with a controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;When the call comes. Will you be the one to answer?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel back to the glory days of the 80's with this arcade inspired space bullet hell.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player you navigate the Javelin, a spaceship fitted with a state of the art weapon arsenal and it's your job to\u00a0 defeat the enemies and bosses in order to unlock powerful new power-ups that can help you on your journey.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter powerful enemies, challenging bosses and many hidden secrets within the arcade realm of Splicer.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get the highest score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power through and reach a higher score to cement your place among the best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel the legends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery surrounding the Palladins as you champion through the game. Each tidbit of information will help you piece together the puzzle. Who were they? Where are they now?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock your potential</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses to unlock new power-ups to enhance your next run and increase your chances at going defeating the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as the classics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate the retro filter in order to get the authentic 80's feel of old CRT monitors.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full controller support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splicer has full controller support for most modern controllers and is best enjoyed with a controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Blast enemies, get ship upgrades and defeat bosses in this arcade inspired space bullet hell",
